Patch: FromRadio Tag Descriptions
File: lib/meshtastic-arduino_src/mt_protocol.cpp
Date: 2026-02-17

Purpose:
  Replaces the numeric-only "FromRadio tag: N" debug output with human-readable
  descriptions (e.g., "FromRadio tag: 2 (received message)") to make serial
  debug output easier to interpret.

  This is a debug-only enhancement behind #if DEBUG_MESHTASTIC_CONNECTION.

Before:
  Serial.printf("FromRadio tag: %d\n", fromRadio.which_payload_variant);

After:
  Lookup array with plain-English descriptions for each tag value (0-15),
  printed as: "FromRadio tag: N (description)"
